{"title":"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 25","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> in the adjoining figure, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/5/bc56862b1fdb71204894da278e42ef75de73a40b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/6/9a65c05bd85d2609bea5db2b109ed5f556463511.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AE$\" width=\"27\" height=\"13\" /> trisect <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/6/5862947b38a495ec9be80e5b9c7582de6cf0d269.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BAC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"57\" height=\"14\" />. The lengths of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/f/89fff82bb65d0215e49c8c91cb7c553da52205e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/5/6d5c9afa92ae3180f02754c177e530d9d0f8b4d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/7/a771251838750a4cb9926c5e2b03324b2b2edae7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, respectively. The length of the shortest side of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/2/7f240d5cbd098de4683dae9165d6b39047397a2e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] defaultpen(linewidth(.8pt)); pair A = (0,11); pair B = (2,0); pair D = (4,0); pair E = (7,0); pair C = (13,0); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,A,N); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,B,SW); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,C,SE); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,D,S); label(&quot;$E$&quot;,E,S); label(&quot;$2$&quot;,midpoint(B--D),N); label(&quot;$3$&quot;,midpoint(D--E),NW); label(&quot;$6$&quot;,midpoint(E--C),NW); draw(A--B--C--cycle); draw(A--D); draw(A--E); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"232\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/7/6073ac7eb2c3c1f8d8734e17fe34269e0ba09b09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2\\sqrt{10}\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 11\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 6\\sqrt{6}\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 6\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{not uniquely determined by the given information}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"770\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/0/be0834a58059a61a79d86701cc1292ee73a0858c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC=b$\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/4/474cd45035e0eea00cfc2d9355528e69dc34389d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB=c$\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/8/408367a8b7b4d1f8bf77a8446cf7a956d03ec105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD=d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"65\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/1/d3191cf8a4752e80ea190dd274175ec6500f5ab4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AE=e$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"63\" height=\"14\" />. Then, by the Angle Bisector Theorem, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/8/678518543f736140a02a4010378b1e3cdac02dbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{c}{e}=\\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"52\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/3/e23fe505fa8e148a94b2ddd00df97e6cec2f7b1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{d}{b}=\\frac12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"53\" height=\"39\" />, thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/b/85bf29e6efd96b5a9989ec50d017001b0b22905f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$e=\\frac{3c}2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"55\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/b/95b1d5c24ab05eb30c2c8d418e65e9d3149115a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d=\\frac b2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"49\" height=\"39\" />.\n</p><p>Also, by Stewart’s Theorem, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/f/32f0a8202beabc04b26eed33483529e8311e5d81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$198+11d^2=2b^2+9c^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"182\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/6/c667f71644d7545e18747b687b2724561f9074ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$330+11e^2=5b^2+6c^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"181\" height=\"18\" />. Therefore, we have the following system of equations using our substitution from earlier:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/d/20d84433af79b77751b49930e55af2d8c008afe1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{cases}198=-\\frac{3b^2}4+9c^2\\\\330=5b^2-\\frac{75c^2}{4}\\end{cases}.\\]\" width=\"172\" height=\"53\" />\n</p><p>Thus, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/f/72f2dde8265a5e370dd9e3b387082355768c8fc7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{cases}264=-b^2+12c^2\\\\264=4b^2-15c^2\\end{cases}.\\]\" width=\"173\" height=\"53\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/f/7dfa51f3570ac5bc14546e313238827a60e3aa46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5b^2=27c^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/f/d0f2f3a1f968c04ff103165c7bbcc56fd412d5ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^2=\\frac{27c^2}5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"79\" height=\"41\" />, thus our first equation from earlier gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/8/2080a61433d72d433c95ceb9eaa90ee71eeac1e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$264=\\frac{33c^2}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"91\" height=\"41\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/3/a23f459cd11c8fddbec07ceb6fe2f56e8174935a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c^2=40$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"17\" />, thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/d/f7d3b948614c118b8ccebfb1201fa9ec9daed33f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^2=216$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"69\" height=\"17\" />. So, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/3/5b38e96d9879008fffe54bdfeffe3ce64ad5c56e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c&lt;b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> and the answer to the original problem is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/8/a48d9bad7c723b376f6725f3adeb1155fb38756e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=\\sqrt{40}=\\boxed{2\\sqrt{10}~\\textbf{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"180\" height=\"35\" />.\n</p><p>~ <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:Aops-g5-gethsemanea2\" title=\"User:Aops-g5-gethsemanea2\">Aops-g5-gethsemanea2</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>To keep the calculations simple, use a variation of stewart's formula for an angle bisector, given by: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/a/9ca908ea7e92aca536b07cc87b6af62038f109b4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$bc=d^2+mn$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"108\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Using this formula and letting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/8/408367a8b7b4d1f8bf77a8446cf7a956d03ec105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AD=d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"65\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/1/d3191cf8a4752e80ea190dd274175ec6500f5ab4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AE=e$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"63\" height=\"14\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/4/274b8096e55e7368aeb9edd72da6bd393f53a311.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB=2e/3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"90\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/a/c4aa19bb91a1708569862dd76554f65641bffa56.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC=2d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Use stewart's to obtain a system of equations, where:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad2ae317bf4873ec89cfa7331f370a2746f989d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2e^2/3 = d^2 + 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"117\" height=\"21\" />, and\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/2/4a2d2d1c53845daa1d66504d6b05628757f4a621.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2d^2 = e^2 + 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"108\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Solve to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/c/4fc0e53d87dc92ddc4a1f9b74710825776c8aef3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d^2 = 54$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"61\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/c/39c845d43289305c6f5754ebc8b5f57584dfd051.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$e^2 = 90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"17\" />. After comparison, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/9/5494da175048f06a080ac4f1df851a4362b1eecc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2d^2 &gt; 2e^2/3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"95\" height=\"21\" /> and we have\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/b/3cb79886fd4aa4ece50557bae7d2c005fdaab793.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2/3 * sqrt(90) = sqrt(40) = 2sqrt(10)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"299\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><br />\n~dinosoap123\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME\" title=\"1981 AHSME\">1981 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1981 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1981\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">Problem 26</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017173534\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.034 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.050 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 257/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2159/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 152/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8324/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.277      1 Template:AHSME_box\n100.00%    7.277      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:22978:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017173534 and revision id 285833. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}